{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Looking for a lighthearted Metroidvania that's isn't gloomy? We've got you covered.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Dewdrop Dynasty</strong></i><strong> is a fast-paced, gun-jumping Metroidvania with a unique, retro-inspired pixel art style.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1444080/extras/e3502fae7b61b3ffe716836169848207.apng?t=1770669512\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1444080/extras/e3502fae7b61b3ffe716836169848207.poster.avif?t=1770669512\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=87 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot, jump, and explore your way through the world of Dewdrop\u2014a interconnected land filled with hidden secrets, diverse biomes, strange monsters, and even stranger inhabitants.   </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With so much to discover, bosses to face, and puzzles to solve, <i>Dewdrop Dynasty</i> bursts with charm, challenge, and fast-paced fun. <strong>The world of Dewdrop won\u2019t explore itself\u2014so what are you waiting for?</strong> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1444080/extras/bd065bd1b08a988af78ffd3b3b1431f0.apng?t=1770669512\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1444080/extras/bd065bd1b08a988af78ffd3b3b1431f0.poster.avif?t=1770669512\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=102 /></picture></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1444080/extras/960a2d906241cfe74076ac7ca5a96bba.webp?t=1770669512\" width=20 height=14 /></span>\u00a0Harness your inner gunslinger with gun-jumping, pistol-whipping action</p><p cla